Package: flourishR
Title: Tools for Reproducible Wellbeing and Survey Data Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Taylor",
        family = "Hill",
        email = "thill001@dundee.ac.uk",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides lightweight tools for common tasks in wellbeing and
    survey data analysis, including recoding survey missing values,
    converting labelled variables, checking missingness, scoring
    multi-item scales, conducting analyses across countries, and
    visualising cross-national and longitudinal outcomes. Functions are
    designed to support transparent and reproducible workflows with
    large-scale survey and longitudinal data.
